Views_PoolRegistry_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given empty roster
│  ├── it should return zero pool count
│  ├── it should return zero active pool count
│  ├── it should return an empty pool ids array
│  ├── it should return an empty pools array
│  ├── it should return zero epoch
│  └── it should return a config with status none
└── given populated roster
   ├── it should return the roster size as pool count
   ├── it should count only active allocatable pools
   ├── it should list every pool id
   ├── it should list every pool with its config
   ├── it should derive pool ids from the offchain string
   └── it should keep views consistent after demote and remove
